Hi,
I’m trying to launch RServe.exe directly from a java app, sample code :
-----
try{

Runtime runtime = Runtime.getRuntime();
runtime.exec("C:\\Program Files\\R\\R-2.4.0\\bin\\Rserve.exe");

Rconnection c = new Rconnection();
System.out.println("Submit the R source file : ");
c.eval("source('TestCode.txt')");
c.close();
}
catch(Exception e){
System.out.println(" exception !");
e.printStackTrace();

}
-----

